(text "NVMe (M.2 Key M) and USB 3.0 host ports" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 14 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "62bf212b-73e6-5719-ae28-ea9572d47d7a"))
(text "PCIe x1: TX AC-coupling capacitors are on the CM5, RX capacitors are on the SSD. Route as 90 ohm pairs (CM5 datasheet 2.3).\nUSB VBUS: TPS2561 dual switch, about 1.2A per port (R_ILIM 47k). Each port has 150uF bulk as USB requires 120uF minimum." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e8764098-07e9-592a-af54-b6f2a734b7e0"))
